UID:6ab56c370c7bf418f4e3d90f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join City of Toronto Urban Forestry staff for a presentation o
 n invasive plants commonly found around homes in Toronto.\nLearn how to id
 entify these species\, understand their impact\, and effectively manage th
 em. You’ll also get tips on supporting local biodiversity through enhanc
 ing native habitats. Perfect for gardeners\, homeowners\, and anyone inter
 ested in urban ecology. Drop-in. No registration required.
