DESCRIPTION:Get a glimpse of High Park the way it was through the memories
  and family stories of people who were there.\nBack Lane Studios presents 
 Mapping Our Memories\, a project collecting place-based stories from older
  people in video and written formats.\nJoin us to see a curated selectio
 n of short documentaries\, learn about Mapping Our Memories\, and meet som
 e of the people behind the stories during a Q&A.\nDrop in\, no registrati
 on required.
LOCATION:High Park\, Program Room
