DESCRIPTION:Please join us for an afternoon screening of "The Devil Wears 
 Prada".\nThe Devil Wears Prada\n(2006)\nRunning time: 109 minutes\nDirecto
 r: David Frankel\nStarring: Meryl Streep\, Anne Hathaway\, Emily Blunt\, a
 nd Stanley Tucci\nIt tells a story of Andy Sachs\, an aspiring journalist 
 who gets a job at a fashion magazine but finds herself at the mercy of her
  demanding editor\, Miranda Priestly.\nThe North York Central Library Film
  Club meets monthly on Wednesdays. There is a short\, informal discussion 
 after the screening\, time permitting.\nRegistration is not required. Plea
 se contact the Browsery Department at 416-395-5672 for more information.\n
 Next dates:\nNov 11 -\nThe Devil Wears Prada 2 (2026)\nDec 16 - TBA
