SUMMARY:Ghost Phenomena: Discoveries of the Searcher Group
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261024T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261024T140000
UID:6a9867402dac6e0037238e7b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Over forty years ago\, The Searcher Group (TSG) – Canada’s
  oldest\, most reputable and accomplished paranormal research team – was
  founded. Join TSG Assistant Director and author Peter Roe for a fascinati
 ng look at experiments\, photos and real encounters from the field. Skepti
 cs\, believers and the curious alike are invited to attend this judgment-f
 ree event and stay for the Q&A at the end.\nAn optional\npre-show\nwill be
  held from 12:00 PM – 12:30 PM.\nThis is an in-person program with a cap
 acity of roughly 30 seats.\nNo registration required.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 101\, 1st Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a9867402dac6e0037238e7b
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
