SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Spoken Word Workshop - Affirmations to Confidence
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261117T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261117T173000
UID:6a970a812dac6e0037234055@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop\, Coach Joshua Watkis will address the self-s
 crutiny faced by youth in the digital age by using poetry and self-reflec
 tion as tools for positive reinforcement. Participants will learn how to 
 identify\, affirm\, and articulate their intrinsic value by mastering the
  basics of metaphors and similes and utilizing the psychological and poet
 ic power of targeted repetition and group affirmations.\nThis program is p
 art of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after
  school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Fre
 e\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth H
