DESCRIPTION:Civic Innovation Consultation sessions are recurring opportuni
 ties throughout the residency where community members can connect with the
  Innovator in Residence (IiR) 1:1 or in small groups regarding civic techn
 ology\, open data\, community projects\, or ideas they may be developing.\
 nThis program is part of TPL's Innovator in Residence series focused on ci
 vic innovation. From October 5 to November 28\, join programs\, workshops 
 and one-on-one consultations led by technology strategist Ismail Mohamud t
 o learn how technology can help you create positive change in your communi
 ty. Learn more at\ntpl.ca/iir\n.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe pers
