BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Boba Drink Making Workshop For Teens
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261105T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261105T180000
UID:6ac7e375fee2d21deb22049e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:​Chef Yumiko leads a hands-on workshop to make the popular A
 sian beverage\, Brown Sugar Milk with Boba.  Participants will learn to pr
 epare and use the classic ingredients​ including milk\, molasses and tap
 ioca pearls to make this visually pleasing and sweet drink. Chef Yumiko wi
 ll also provide a brief history of Boba and why it's so popular globally.\
 nThis program is for\nTeens ages 13-17\nRegistration required.\nFood aller
 gy notice: Please be aware that food will be used in this program. Food pr
 oducts used in this program may contain or may have come into contact with
  common allergens. (*Contains dairy\, sugar\, and caffeine)
LOCATION:Rexdale - Closed
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac7e375fee2d21deb22049e
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
