DESCRIPTION:We bring in a real civic innovator: an organizer\, technologis
 t\, or advocate to share their story and take your questions. Then they le
 ad a hands-on civic activity to get you thinking and collaborating. Every 
 Civic Spotlight is different because every guest brings something new.\nAr
 rive 30 minutes before or stay 30 minutes after the program for one-on-one
  consultations.\nThis program is part of TPL's Innovator in Residence seri
 es focused on civic innovation. From October 5 to November 28\, join progr
 ams\, workshops and one-on-one consultations led by technology strategist 
 Ismail Mohamud to learn how technology can help you create positive change
  in your community. Learn more at\ntpl.ca/iir\n.\nInformation Collection N
 otice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto 
