 \, conditional arguments and much more.\nThis class is for beginners but a
 ssumes you have a basic understanding of computer skills -- basically\, if
  you can use a word processor or surf the web\, you can learn Python!\nReg
 istration will start 2 weeks before this class. Computers will be provided
 .\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form i
