DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261204T190000
UID:6aa1b25fd9692700553437e1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn to Play Dungeons and Dragons!\nThis is a drop-in\, learn
 -to-play program for\nteens\n.  Space limited. 1st Level Pre-generated cha
 racter available.  All supplies provided.\nRegister in-person in the Youth
  Hub at 4:30PM.
