DESCRIPTION:Come to Thorncliffe Youth Hub for Video Games on Tournament Tu
 esdays! Have fun and battle for first place! No registration is required. 
 Drop-in only.\nTuesday\, October 6: Bingo\nTuesday\, October 13: Jenga\nTu
 esday\, October 20: UNO\nTuesday\, October 27: Chess\nTuesdays in October\
 , 4 - 5 pm\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a we
 lcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful sta
 ff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Dro
 p by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Thorncliffe\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa2e3834ea230006f339110
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:FRESH Movie Saturdays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261010T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261010T130000
UID:6a81ea51452bb101b5758f63@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This program helps people stay active\, make friends\, learn n
 ew skills\, and have fun. Meet new folks\, build connections\, and tell us
  about programs and services you would like to see in the neighbourhood!\n
 Come join us every Saturday for screenings of your favourite movies. In ad
 dition to this\, enjoy cuddles with a therapy dog! Therapy dog Goose visi
 ts Fort York Branch on alternate Saturdays from 11:00AM-12:00PM.\nWe'll b
 e showing the following films:\nOct 3 - The Shaggy Dog (1959)\nOct 10 - Pl
 anes\, Trains and Automobiles\nOct 17 - Toy Story 5\nOct 24 - The Absent M
 inded Professor (1961)\nOct 31 - Hotel Transylvania\nNov 7 - Herbie the L
 ove Bug (1968)\nNov 14 - Africa-An Cats\nNov 21 - The Odd Life of Timothy 
 Green\nNov 28 - Little Big League\nDec 5 – Dog Man\nDec 12 – Toy Stor
 y 5\nDec 19 - A Muppet Christmas Carol\nDrop-ins are welcome.\nThis progra
 m is in collaboration with\nGerstein Crisis Centre's F.R.E.S.H. initiative
 \n.
LOCATION:Fort York\, Urban Living Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a81ea51452bb101b5758f63
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
