BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Henna Art Workshop for Teens
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261027T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261027T173000
UID:6ab40e4319094f0c69396302@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This henna art program will offer participants the opportunity
  to create their own unique henna designs. Through guided instruction\, pa
 rticipants learn about the history and cultural significance of henna\, as
  well as techniques for creating intricate patterns. Participants are enco
 uraged to explore their creativity and design their own patterns\, which t
 hey then apply using henna paste. Through hands-on experience\, participan
 ts can express themselves artistically while learning a traditional art fo
 rm.\nInformation Collection Notice: The personal information on this form 
 is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\
 , sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used fo
 r event and program registration\, delivery\, and evaluation. Questions ab
 out how the library handles your information can be directed to Answerline
  staff at answerline@tpl.ca\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON
  M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Deer Park\, Room 204
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab40e4319094f0c69396302
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bibimbap Rice Bowl with Chef Sang
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261014T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261014T163000
UID:6a8c5a4460ccaf01c0208b44@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn to create a classic Korean dish in this hands-on cooking
  program for teens! Writer\, chef\, and TV host Sang Kim teaches teens how
  to make bibimbap\, a savoury rice bowl meal topped with seasoned vegetabl
 es\, cooked egg\, and a delicious vinegar sauce. (Vegetarians are welcome 
 to participate and may opt out of using the egg.) Participants will leave 
 with a delicious meal and a greater understanding of the essential role of
  rice bowls in Asian cuisine.\nAllergy warning: egg\, sesame oil\, sesame 
 seed
LOCATION:Annette Street\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a8c5a4460ccaf01c0208b44
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
