 PL staff.\nArrive 30 minutes before or stay 30 minutes after the program f
 or one-on-one consultations.\nThis program is part of TPL's Innovator in R
 esidence series focused on civic innovation. From October 5 to November 28
 \, join programs\, workshops and one-on-one consultations led by technolog
 y strategist Ismail Mohamud to learn how technology can help you create po
 sitive change in your community. Learn more at\ntpl.ca/iir\n.\nInformation
