 er-of-pearl craft through a contemporary hands-on art experience. Using ge
 nuine mother-of-pearl pieces\, participants decorate a pre-made Moon Jar f
 orm with their own colour and pattern design\, creating a unique 4 x 4-inc
 h artwork to take home. Beginner-friendly and no previous art experience r
 equired.\nAll teens are welcome! Drop-in\, no registration required.\nThis
  program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place fo
 r teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always av
 ailable. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch wi
 th a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Northern District\, Youth Hub (on the second floor)
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac92580c6cddb0045962806
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
