DESCRIPTION:​Learn the basics of how to make the classic Italian dessert
 \, Tiramisu. Chef Yumiko will provide and explain all the ingredients and 
 take the participants through a simple step-by-step process of creating a 
 delicious ready-to-eat dish.\n​Food allergy notice: Please be aware that
  food will be used in this program that include dairy\, wheat flour\, egg 
 and decaffeinated espresso.  The audience should be advised that certain f
 ood ingredients may cause allergic reactions in some people.\nAll teens ar
 e welcome! Drop-in\, no registration required.\nThis program is part of Yo
 uth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school a
 nd in the summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutri
 tious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor ca
 ll the branch to find out more.
