DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261114T153000
UID:6ab3118eda318a10e63608eb@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Coach & poet Shelly Campbell teaches participants techniques 
 for worldbuilding in poetry. Participants will learn how to imagine and a
 nalyze different worlds through the concepts of utopias and dystopias\, a
 nd explore how poetry can be used to challenge inequality and rewrite his
 tory.\nDrop-in!
