UID:6a8f1b374995480655ec8221@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join a lively Dungeons & Dragons workshop and discover a world
  of creativity and collaboration. Participants will enjoy a guided session
  of adventure that sparks imagination\, builds teamwork\, and introduces a
  creative\, fun\, story-driven game in a welcoming setting. The game can h
 ave up to 6 participants!
