BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Button-Making
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261023T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261023T173000
UID:6aa9833c101eb7003f3048d8@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Express yourself and show off your unique style! Join us in th
 e Youth Hub to design and create your very own\ncustom pin-back buttons\n
 . Bring your own printed photos\, cut up old magazines from our recycled c
 raft bin\, or draw a completely original masterpiece by hand. We provide a
 ll the specialized tools.\nPin back buttons have long been considered wear
 able art\, serving as a tool for\nadvocacy\, identity\, and personal expre
 ssion\n. We will teach you how to condense complex ideas into snappy text 
 and eye-catching circular graphics using digital tools like photoshop or 
 traditional art materials. Teens will learn the mechanics of operating a\n
 manual button-press machine\nand leave with a collection of wearable art p
 ieces to showcase their personal style or support a cause.\nThis program i
 s part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens af
 ter school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always available. 
 Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYout
 h Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, Auditorium\, lower level
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa9833c101eb7003f3048d8
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Fall Film Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261016T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261016T180000
UID:6a91c8f569166f088b959a50@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Cozy up by the fire and enjoy a movie with friends.\nAre we wa
 tching an action-packed adventure\, a cheesy rom-com\, or an uproariously 
 funny comedy? Vote for your favourite movie in the Youth Hub. We’ll show
  the film with the most votes.\nThis is a drop-in Youth Hub program for\nt
