DESCRIPTION:Interested in creating your own 3D models? Join us for an intr
 oduction to Onshape\, a powerful cloud-based Computer-Aided Design (CAD) s
 oftware used by engineers\, designers\, and makers around the world.\nIn t
 his beginner-friendly workshop\, participants will learn the fundamentals 
