 basic sketches\, and turn those sketches into 3D objects using extrude and
  extrude cut features. No previous CAD experience is required.\nBy the end
  of the program\, participants will have created their own simple 3D model
  and gained the skills needed to continue exploring CAD design on their ow
 n.\nBasic Computer skills are Mandatory\nInformation Collection Notice:\nT
