 d developing practical strategies for coping with life’s challenges.\nPa
 rt 1: Foundations of Mental Wellness (4 weeks\, Every Friday\, 2-3:30 pm\,
  Oct 30 - Nov 20\, 2026)\nExplore core concepts related to mental health 
 and well-being\, build a foundation for personal growth\, and connect with
  others through shared learning and discussion.\nPart 2: Building Resilien
 ce\n(4 weeks\, Every Friday\, 2-3:30 pm\, Nov 27 - Dec 18\, 2026)\nRecogni
 se your strengths and develop personalised strategies for navigating chall
 enges\, building resilience and maintaining mental wellness.\nRegister for
  Part 2\nseparately.\nTTC Presto tickets will be provided.\nSnacks and ref
 reshments are provided for all participants. Ingredient lists will be av
 ailable at the program.\nRegistration is required.\nAttend all 4 sessions 
 in Part 1 to receive a certificate.\nThis program is in collaboration wit
 h\nCanadian Mental Health Association Toronto\n.\nInformation Collection N
 otice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto 
 Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, a
